title: Example Builds
---

The images use these colors:

- Orange: core
- Green: planter block
- Red: power block
- Brown: fertilizer block
- Blue: export block
- Purple: ME block (optional)
- Gray: frame block (does nothing)
- Pale translucent blue: glass

The glass canopy is decoration only. Glass is not part of the multiblock, and the built-in cloche needs no item.

## Raised bed under a cloche

Corner legs, a 3x3 bed and a 3x3 glass canopy.

<ModAsset location="modular_planters:builds/raised_bed" width={512} />

## Vertical farm

A 2x2 tower with the core on the bottom floor and floors of planter blocks above it.

<ModAsset location="modular_planters:builds/vertical_farm" width={512} />

## Rosette

One block tall. The core is in the center, the other parts take the four diagonal corners, and planter blocks extend outward in four arms.

<ModAsset location="modular_planters:builds/rosette" width={512} />

These builds are examples only. Any shape works as long as every part touches the core or another part face to face, within the rules on the [Building Rules](building) page.
